#: scenario6:scenario6_C0D8ECB4_C3F3_4F7B_A234_A58E84B88C67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb6d43c0b57fe2713a463c5eb62bf82547712c449861f67d4717ee664990af7d
#. default-sha256: 3b3407a013be588842e7927b7ed03c9ad9bc4b4e542cfa59b73e1a18e912797f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C0D8ECB4_C3F3_4F7B_A234_A58E84B88C67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫Several hundred years after I was enslaved within the mansion,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫わたしが館に囚われてから、⟪k:37⟫何百年か経過した頃――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DFCA190C_9381_49EB_AF34_7594F696866E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2af03a4ce93d15cc8a745aa57248a9f5f7996a3f2cd3eb500ca171b8697ca9ca
#. default-sha256: ce09a0f779e092a16e150a5dee2c5d64a9e2ac433b4530e043f269b63ab1b681
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DFCA190C_9381_49EB_AF34_7594F696866E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫something changed for the very first time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫初めて、⟪k:1⟫屋敷に変化が訪れました。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_A17834CC_C534_4890_9DF7_B42A8279E7D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96ec63df8214f9d8ac852b3c94e967d6f0097bf1bea86f9b67c6b225a976d0cc
#. default-sha256: 067b4bc4f8685ca57e2a985441f75ec5e5801f9dae0b7795ccbf301fb1a80b7e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_A17834CC_C534_4890_9DF7_B42A8279E7D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sunlight, which I had not seen in all that time, shone in from outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう……、⟪k:1⟫わたしの目に、⟪k:2⟫懐かしい日差しが入り込んだのです。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_B5740C44_6B5C_4BB8_A2B1_5BAB28C78E13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ceda0e38f4c343d7830975695ab3084d05b7b1350da39b7fa426afc8a8629d3
#. default-sha256: cafdb29000a48e815866e3dfa8415e3452b804e3036d0e40efde3abfda66c379
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_B5740C44_6B5C_4BB8_A2B1_5BAB28C78E13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At first, I did not believe it was real. ⟪k:1⟫I thought it was a hallucination born of my "
"inner desires."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫最初、⟪k:1⟫それが現実だとは思いませんでした。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫わたしの願望が見せている光景なのだと感"
"じたのです。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d56587bfe4d0f9dc85eb809592c07611206dca1f3acd2577b5bc25566cd7ed46
#. default-sha256: 3d61dec5712038f3df14a161865ee425c6f4d0300a56b6f8edd72b097039e5a0
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I thought I must have completely lost it for my fantasies to have escaped my mind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫妄想の世界が視界に映り込んでしまうくらい、⟪k:2⟫わたしはもう気が狂っているのだ"
"と……そんな風に思いました。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E0EFF0B0_F4EC_4C86_8C4E_09D63CF82B05
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60a128482cb3e40465133169d576b3cf94fd41f4bfca42ae7b10d9223377a595
#. default-sha256: cbf1892ad614d46f0db7dd5e873635b323800ba760de975e08abdec89b14aa97
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E0EFF0B0_F4EC_4C86_8C4E_09D63CF82B05"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The time has come, Giselle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s time for you to get to work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫さあ、⟪k:2⟫ジゼル。⟪k:3⟫あなたの仕事の時間がやってきましたよ。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_34F6CBFA_78F3_45B3_8F31_59CFF12DE53C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 930fe6d6b9b88511c6f1ba9fa8566d08333e4f83451b25575352714b9b1e9652
#. default-sha256: 6648a8e41fe9c80d176bb47147d4e4cdcf4bb755c876ca53b7bbd74063c392f2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_34F6CBFA_78F3_45B3_8F31_59CFF12DE53C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Reveling in the sight of the outside was the last thing I should have been doing,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……わたしはその光景に感動などしている場合ではなかったのです。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫この時、⟪k:3⟫この瞬間か"
"らこそが――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_80F86752_F15F_4301_8AE2_C505E3FD8C04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd6d38c6242ab085e70c62e4bfd63ab5b013707187023644a054866249d0e1d0
#. default-sha256: 464a0507271955a57b5f318d1ffd169a5ab06a446ce884a43f04658a6232d79a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_80F86752_F15F_4301_8AE2_C505E3FD8C04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Work? What kind of work?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……仕事って、⟪k:1⟫どういうことですか……？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D477F6A9_07C6_4A3B_B245_F7D67FF2FA52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dafa70835a30b344cb5b8425ea411bd51d3f95bcc0257175139d20f9a1177ee0
#. default-sha256: ea663c74927109b2e60177b93b2db3539ac7648a69fe7647983098bc80df7e32
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D477F6A9_07C6_4A3B_B245_F7D67FF2FA52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I said, I need you to watch over the house,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and show your utmost hospitality to "
"those who show up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私、⟪k:1⟫言いましたよね。⟪k:2⟫あなたはこのお屋敷を見守らなければならないと。⟪k:3⟫……誰かが訪れ"
"たら、⟪k:4⟫もてなすのだと。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0836612C_FBFD_4359_8344_81C40AE9F202
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 652eb82529964ad9f980455189ef7e3e247d20ab92602118f449c18eb8ea4a17
#. default-sha256: 0a9452d75ee911917c3fe4b43ec1e09b21504003f7c637960d67d4c31b4dbb99
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0836612C_FBFD_4359_8344_81C40AE9F202"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is someone..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……誰かが……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_A469E825_CE1A_4518_B691_B78A80D10F5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc773ead9a5b0dafbb9813b0e9e218afc9ea3ed47ad9da8af2c2550ccb7fe819
#. default-sha256: 929f1d24e271c9b663568a3ff9e9ed8945b885b719324c033c30e4903764d94e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_A469E825_CE1A_4518_B691_B78A80D10F5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫H-⟪k:1⟫Hold on!⟪k:2⟫I-⟪k:3⟫I have no idea what I’m supposed to do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫――ま、⟪k:1⟫待って！　⟪k:2⟫わたし、⟪k:3⟫な、⟪k:4⟫なにをすればいいのか……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b297cff78ae606085d0243b96ddcf11643da4833b3f800e0c735e38b7be3cb2d
#. default-sha256: 876d9d3ce2aee37eabeacceba65e528862e9bedb2b9ac174e05cf049ac82868a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do the same thing you have been doing—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫be a maid.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Convince the house’s "
"guests that this is a wonderful place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫これまでと変わらず、⟪k:1⟫使用人を続ければ良いのです。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫この館がとても素晴らしいものだ"
"と、⟪k:4⟫居心地の良いものだと――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6871f33f0558f8b4f01694c9332ee893531ce729ec41b44e25439b8158b9459
#. default-sha256: c6e5ac859b78ee6de0495ade462fdee252abf80eefbc84ee46b1fc7760ca9a98
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Make them enjoy their stay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなたが、⟪k:1⟫思わせるのです。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_70266F3D_E042_48CB_AB84_325DB04F15EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d90aa275fb6e6f888bfd49f3f22169a730cd1cb6181cd9ba89db041376247c0f
#. default-sha256: 769d0cb15f0ba0e66c98186ede42b8309903f16d9e1fc33cf8883ba2cb10a9fb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_70266F3D_E042_48CB_AB84_325DB04F15EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(But will the door... ⟪k:1⟫open?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（扉が――、⟪k:1⟫開く……？）"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C4E828DB_696C_4F5D_9A09_04597E774214
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f32fa2b372fd7eda3c93fc57fdd5d8b05165922f74d24703507970e1c1e60df
#. default-sha256: 00d974a6b328c8f1f4e91ec6faccfe70f3174a871c22156c944c60dbf8db8aeb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C4E828DB_696C_4F5D_9A09_04597E774214"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For so long, the door had refused to budge.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For so long, light had forsaken "
"these halls.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫For so long, there had been no trace of life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫決して開くことのなかった扉。⟪k:2⟫決して光の差し込まなかった窓。⟪k:3⟫生き物の気配など何ひ"
"とつなかった館。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D2037F95_74B5_451B_A296_F78BD0F5D9DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab5d1f96de3e75b58ce19f4595e99772417253c0e84d64d1261a8222eeec63d9
#. default-sha256: ce69ea3a2ee2e4aa546be73aa4897cfd7795f437ae183c1ca95d9edcc81ecc53
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D2037F95_74B5_451B_A296_F78BD0F5D9DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And now, all of that had been turned on its head."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫すべてが、⟪k:1⟫覆されておりました。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_48D2F6F0_DB1E_47E7_BCE8_38526208AA81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ebe89667aea67f3b0ed75b928711c79a3514cdc522069ee79c7d585bd2d243e
#. default-sha256: c288f6238a4c6e0d9c6345778f2d17aedd913e9511ba6dc595333873abb7431b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_48D2F6F0_DB1E_47E7_BCE8_38526208AA81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was almost certainly a perfectly ordinary slice of nature.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Leaves and grass "
"rustled in the wind, flowers specked the earth,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫きっと、⟪k:1⟫何の変哲もない郊外の光景だったのだと思います。⟪k:2⟫草木が揺れていて、⟪k:3⟫小さな"
"花がぽつぽつと咲いていて……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D13D5DE9_195F_4D3C_81C4_5F28348226CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: becac0c01a1f647ddbf0312a6ed45b5b9b7536c6319b7d0feeef3822a0f62dd5
#. default-sha256: bed8601975d44ff693323b4880287a2d9322eb4c1d937aa92c50d73017635a83
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D13D5DE9_195F_4D3C_81C4_5F28348226CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and in the distance was a city I didn’t recognize."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫遠くには、⟪k:1⟫見たこともない街が見えました。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_74392373_5663_4CF6_84BF_B3306B93FFFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_74392373_5663_4CF6_84BF_B3306B93FFFC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9AABB09C_CF88_4A18_A3CA_56C00600AA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10b0a69f47ae9c08f8c6d8aa53c464c3fe7f7d02258af14fb3f9dd2006d8bdd0
#. default-sha256: 08db319305ce373c4d18057ac28a8a103ac7563efb95b5cbe0c705cac3d2cb4b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9AABB09C_CF88_4A18_A3CA_56C00600AA69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I was standing there idly before the entrance, a carriage rolled up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫やがて、⟪k:2⟫館の入り口でぼんやりと立ち尽くしていると、⟪k:3⟫一台の馬車が近づいてきまし"
"た。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F3B45874_CAF6_4E5B_AE11_85DD6996100F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F3B45874_CAF6_4E5B_AE11_85DD6996100F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9724AECD_04EF_42BA_A8BE_8767E042080F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce782bb4abf777bb317e3046c932a79eb268008698c011e627ebd5e7c6a523cd
#. default-sha256: e4c6643f3965d99fd0fd89dbd2103088f15fddf188bdc9b75d682880a0f199dd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9724AECD_04EF_42BA_A8BE_8767E042080F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mm? And who might you be, young lady?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That outfit..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ん？　⟪k:1⟫お前さんは……どこの誰だね？　⟪k:2⟫それに、⟪k:3⟫その恰好……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2BA96708_D781_43B5_984B_CAB87143E16E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4de2db1693718a402e0b0dddd50f5d3cdb2dfda27b788edb2f08e8ce48516232
#. default-sha256: cd0099fd6285a642dea88e802599c8c2bac1993c354e2003e1dc54a533ccaae6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2BA96708_D781_43B5_984B_CAB87143E16E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Could the mansion... ⟪k:1⟫have moved somewhere far, far away...?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（この館は、⟪k:1⟫もしかして、⟪k:2⟫とんでもなく遠い場所に……）"

#: scenario6:scenario6_3368DB51_6FE4_4865_9B98_E0C8669209D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d22ce6ccf6007ebc0c1f37bcabc8c7ff25c866e7f437def95a9a2811a960d468
#. default-sha256: 9a318d9228744d0b583382f7e73f098a5c9bf9b6748991cf8f925db6d5cf2fcf
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_3368DB51_6FE4_4865_9B98_E0C8669209D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Naturally, I had no idea how such a thing was possible."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なぜそんなことが起こり得るのか、⟪k:1⟫理解など出来ませんでした。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D43BC81C_DC3C_4882_B12A_C944953139E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0903bf9b5d4b40b80d93f8ea781479dce5b886e2d413b15da75a36dc7ed79f9f
#. default-sha256: 41f77e7b2fe6f972d7ffad57c8ba954fd5b893a606fa19b87d2318654d56ad98
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D43BC81C_DC3C_4882_B12A_C944953139E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My immediate mission was to overcome the language barrier."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫とにかく目下の問題――言葉の壁を乗り越えることが、⟪k:1⟫急務であると思いました。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_8FA79258_DF70_48F7_9CB8_87476012B44C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47fafe9b80a4c089f9c12d2e2176f519559165d58ee41e211b7c154c90c20bb9
